{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19260","headline":"送陆侍御归淮南使府五韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"送陆侍御归淮南使府五韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江左重诗篇，陆生名久传。\n凤城来已熟，羊酪不嫌羶。\n归路芙蓉府，离堂玳瑁筵。\n泰山呈腊雪，隋柳布新年。\n曾忝扬州荐，因君达短牋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}